{"4362490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "99 NIGHTS IN THE APOCALYPSE", "steam_appid": 4362490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5148750], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>99 Nights in the Apocalypse</strong> is a chaotic co-op survival game where you and your friends have one simple job: survive 99 nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362490/extras/711a5b43fdfada2bd4bd77e051c0d804.poster.avif?t=1787690761\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362490/extras/711a5b43fdfada2bd4bd77e051c0d804.webm?t=1787690761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362490/extras/711a5b43fdfada2bd4bd77e051c0d804.mp4?t=1787690761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, explore the park, scavenge for loot, chop trees, hunt animals, rescue survivors, and drag whatever useful junk you can find back to camp. Build, craft, upgrade, and prepare for nightfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because at night, things get weird.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362490/extras/1834fb3ae4f83bee9b9fb8d095233f01.poster.avif?t=1787690761\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362490/extras/1834fb3ae4f83bee9b9fb8d095233f01.webm?t=1787690761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362490/extras/1834fb3ae4f83bee9b9fb8d095233f01.mp4?t=1787690761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escaped asylum patients, deranged doctors, unhinged nurses, and things you probably shouldn't make eye contact with come out of the darkness. Defend your camp, keep the fire burning, save your friends, and somehow make it to sunrise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day lets you explore farther and get stronger. Every night gets more dangerous. And every terrible decision your friends make becomes your problem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore. Build. Survive. Cause problems. Make it through 99 nights.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive Escalating Nights</strong><br>Every night gets harder, stranger, and more chaotic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362490/extras/40d39a43e5b8bac7a7afa7f1d876d322.poster.avif?t=1787690761\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362490/extras/40d39a43e5b8bac7a7afa7f1d876d322.webm?t=1787690761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362490/extras/40d39a43e5b8bac7a7afa7f1d876d322.mp4?t=1787690761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Building Under Pressure</strong><br>Reinforce barricades, manage your campfire, and decide what’s worth saving.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362490/extras/09746395154387bd35726cb95f4b5bf1.poster.avif?t=1787690761\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362490/extras/09746395154387bd35726cb95f4b5bf1.webm?t=1787690761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362490/extras/09746395154387bd35726cb95f4b5bf1.mp4?t=1787690761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Runs &amp; Permadeath</strong><br>Each run is different, and death means starting over.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362490/extras/88494c2d67fa855f7f544b5c65ecbcc7.poster.avif?t=1787690761\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362490/extras/88494c2d67fa855f7f544b5c65ecbcc7.webm?t=1787690761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4362490/extras/88494c2d67fa855f7f544b5c65ecbcc7.mp4?t=1787690761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized, Darkly Funny World</strong><br>A low-poly post-apocalypse that leans into absurdity, not realism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PvE Focused Gameplay</strong><br>All threats come from the world and its inhabitants.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How Long Can You Last?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s no winning the apocalypse.<br>There’s only lasting a little longer than last time.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>99 Nights in the Apocalypse</strong> is a chaotic co-op survival game where you and your friends have one simple job: survive 99 nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s